  {"sym":"ROSSTECH","name":"Rossell Techsys Limited","q":"Q2 FY27","date":"27 Nov 2026","cmp":1468.8,"shares":4.0269373,"ytd":{"per":"H1 FY27","rev":340.1591,"ebitda":52.6016,"pat":16.7966,"prev":212.3874},"guide":{"rev":null,"em":18,"pm":null},"base":{"y":"FY26","rev":485.1166,"ebitda":67.7107,"pat":21.8925,"toSh":21.8925,"eps":5.81},"years":[{"y":"FY27E","g":60.2,"m":16.5,"dep":20,"int":30,"tax":25,"mi":0,"sh":3.8739},{"y":"FY28E","g":40,"m":18,"dep":25,"int":25,"tax":25,"mi":0,"sh":4.0269},{"y":"FY29E","g":30,"m":19,"dep":30,"int":20,"tax":25,"mi":0,"sh":4.0269}],"sc":{"bear":{"adj":-25,"lo":25,"hi":30,"why":"Semiconductor ramp-up is delayed, order execution slows, interest savings disappoint and capacity expansion takes longer to convert into revenue."},"base":{"adj":0,"lo":35,"hi":45,"why":"Discount to listed defence-electronics peers for smaller scale, high customer and execution requirements, working-capital intensity and financing risk."},"bull":{"adj":25,"lo":50,"hi":60,"why":"Semiconductor growth accelerates, new facility fills quickly, MRO partnerships scale and interest costs fall faster than assumed."}},"peers":"Data Patterns 101.17; MTAR Technologies 94.75; Paras Defence 101.42; Astra Microwave 73.35 (StockAnalysis, 27 Nov 2026; trailing P/E)","assumptions":["FY26 consolidated revenue is 485.1166; EBITDA is 67.7107, calculated as PBT before exceptional items 29.6233 plus depreciation 13.7493 and finance cost 24.3381.","EBITDA basis includes other income throughout; FY26 other income was 5.0784 and H1 FY27 other income was 4.8381. The reports do not identify a recurring-versus-one-off split, so no separate other-income uplift is forecast.","H1 FY27 EBITDA of 52.6016 is derived from PBT before exceptional items 22.6647 plus depreciation 8.7176 and finance cost 21.2193; H1 PAT is 16.7966.","FY27 revenue growth is modelled at 60.2%, matching H1 growth; MD declined to give exact FY27 revenue guidance but said Q3 and Q4 have historically been the strongest quarters.","The 18%-23% EBITDA margin target was not assigned to FY27 by management; Year 1 uses 16.5%, with 18% in FY28 and 19% in FY29 as analyst estimates.","FY27 interest expense is assumed at 30 after the INR300 crore fundraise; MD said proceeds would repay working-capital limits and interest savings should begin in Q3.","FY27 weighted-average shares reflect the 25,72,898 shares allotted on 04 Nov 2026; FY28 and FY29 use the full post-issue share count of 4.0269373 crore.","FY27-FY29 revenue growth, depreciation, interest and margin assumptions are analyst estimates; the confirmed PO book is INR910 crores over 2.5 years and strategic agreements exceed INR3,100 crores over five years."],"checks":["Shares | FY26 paid-up capital 753.93 lakh / face value 2 = 3.7696475 crore; FY26 PAT 21.8925 / EPS 5.81 = 3.7689 crore, within 2%.","Current shares | 3.7696475 crore + 0.2572898 crore preferential issue = 4.0269373 crore; allotment completed 04 Nov 2026.","FY27 revenue pace | H1 340.1591 / 6 = 56.69 monthly; H2 436.94 / 6 = 72.82 monthly, 28.5% higher.","FY27 H2 growth | FY26 H2 revenue 272.7292; FY27E H2 436.94 implies 60.2% growth, matching H1 growth and supported by management's Q3/Q4 seasonality comments.","FY27 margin and PAT | EBITDA 16.5% is an analyst estimate below the long-term 18%-23% target; forecast PAT approximately 55.7, above H1 PAT 16.8.","Forecast build | FY27 777.1, FY28 1087.9 and FY29 1414.3; each year uses one business segment and the stated forecast margin."],"build":[{"y":"FY27E","part":"Engineering and manufacturing","rev":777.1,"m":16.5,"why":"Single operating segment; FY27 growth estimated at the H1 growth rate, supported by the confirmed order book and historically stronger H2."},{"y":"FY28E","part":"Engineering and manufacturing","rev":1087.9,"m":18,"why":"Analyst estimate; new facility, semiconductor customer ramp-up and operating leverage support growth."},{"y":"FY29E","part":"Engineering and manufacturing","rev":1414.3,"m":19,"why":"Analyst estimate; continued semiconductor, aerospace, defence and MRO execution with gradual margin improvement."}],"risks":["Order execution may be delayed by customer qualification, manufacturing ramp-up or delivery schedules; the confirmed PO book is spread over 2.5 years.","Semiconductor growth depends on successful qualification and ramp-up with new global customers; management described this as an emerging business.","Working-capital requirements remain material; if debt repayment and interest savings are slower than expected, earnings conversion may weaken."],"note":"FY29 estimated PAT is approximately 164.1 and EPS approximately 40.7. At 35x-45x P/E, indicative year-three value is approximately 1,425-1,833 per share. This is a value about three years out, not today's fair value. The peer multiples are substantially higher, but a discount is applied for scale, execution and financing risks.","source":"FY26 audited consolidated annual report dated 11 May 2026; Q2/H1 FY27 consolidated financial results dated 06 Nov 2026; preferential allotment filing dated 04 Nov 2026; NSE closing price 27 Nov 2026; peer trailing P/E from StockAnalysis dated 27 Nov 2026.","orig":{"cmp":1468.8,"shares":4.0269373,"years":[{"y":"FY27E","g":60.2,"m":16.5,"dep":20,"int":30,"tax":25,"mi":0,"sh":3.8739},{"y":"FY28E","g":40,"m":18,"dep":25,"int":25,"tax":25,"mi":0,"sh":4.0269},{"y":"FY29E","g":30,"m":19,"dep":30,"int":20,"tax":25,"mi":0,"sh":4.0269}],"sc":{"bear":{"adj":-25,"lo":25,"hi":30,"why":"Semiconductor ramp-up is delayed, order execution slows, interest savings disappoint and capacity expansion takes longer to convert into revenue."},"base":{"adj":0,"lo":35,"hi":45,"why":"Discount to listed defence-electronics peers for smaller scale, high customer and execution requirements, working-capital intensity and financing risk."},"bull":{"adj":25,"lo":50,"hi":60,"why":"Semiconductor growth accelerates, new facility fills quickly, MRO partnerships scale and interest costs fall faster than assumed."}}},"res":{"sym":"ROSSTECH","basis":"Consolidated","notes":[],"baseRes":{"rev":484.39,"ebitda":59.32,"pat":21.9,"eps":5.8},"baseOk":true,"ytdRes":{"rev":340.16,"ebitda":47.76,"pat":16.8,"prev":212.39},"ytdOk":true,"card":{"q":"Q2 FY27","val":{"px":1557.8,"pxDate":"19-11-2026","eps4":7.88,"pe":197.69,"eg":41.47,"gAdj":40,"peg":4.94,"mcap":5873,"sales4":612.16,"ms":9.59,"grade":"B","score":71},"sh":3.77,"shEst":false},"ttm":{"pat":29.73,"from":"Q3 FY26","to":"Q2 FY27"},"cmp":1557.8,"asOf":"19-11-2026","cmpNewer":false}}
